c"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncBroadcastSequence":{"role":"symbol","title":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncbroadcastsequence","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An async sequence that multicasts elements from an upstream sequence to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}